  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FY24-25 Pacific Diplomatic Training In-Country</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity seeks to deliver introductory level diplomatic training to cohorts of up to 30 scholars consisting&#xA0;early in career officers from Pacific Foreign Ministries or related agencies. Training modules include:
&lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Introduction to international diplomacy, tradecraft, protocol, consular services&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Trade policy, trade agreements&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Geostrategic context&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Pacific regional architecture&#xA0;&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Climate change&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;
This course will be delivered in&#xA0;November 2024 in Wellington and March 2025 in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
